      "content": "i mean i'm not saying it's an emergency or anything, it just feels a bit tight. i've had muscle pulls like this before and they usually go away in a day or two with some ice and rest. you're saying i really need to go to a clinic for this? it's just a leg, i don't see why it would be that big of a deal if it's just inflammation. isn't it pretty common for it to look like this after a hike?",
